    vh2j.03a  (512 KB)  CRC32 9ae8f186 -> 1ce8d926
    vh2j.04a  (512 KB)  CRC32 e2fabf53 -> 6b232eae
    vh2j.08  (512 KB)  CRC32 ac873dff -> be9d8a6c

All other files in the set are unmodified.

